        <mxCell id="neZ9D76SEu85InOmIjE7-28" value="&lt;ol id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-9c1bf826-7fff-cbec-5a0d-abe1d1962bff&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Постройте диаграмму классов&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;Не прописывая поля для ассоциаций и идов&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strike&gt;Превратите Many-To-Many|Few в класс с двумя One-To-Many|Few&lt;/strike&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Разделите *-To-Many и *-To-Few&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Для связей One-To-One добавьте ссылку через ид к тому классу, который не может существовать без другого (появлется в системе вторым). Если оба класса могут существовать самостоятельно и появляются независимо - бросьте монетку или погадайте на кофейной гуще&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Для связей One-To-Few добавьте на сторону One ссылку через список идов&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Для связей One-To-Many добавьте на сторону Many ссылку через ид&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:decimal;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#595959;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Проведите транзакционный анализ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot; aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;Для классов, которые связаны One-To-One или One-to-Few и модифицируются в одной транзакции замените ссылки через иды на прямые ссылки&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="neZ9D76SEu85InOmIjE7-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1400" y="42" width="690" height="558" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="neZ9D76SEu85InOmIjE7-29" value="&lt;b&gt;Строка польз. таблица&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;CustomTableRow&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;fillColor=none;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="neZ9D76SEu85InOmIjE7-1">
